<title>USA: Brite Voice Systems Names Gergacz president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Brite Voice Systems Names Gergacz president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brite Voice Systems said on Wednesday that it named David Gergacz president and chief executive officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Gergacz replaces Stanley Brannan, Brite's founder and current CEO.</p>
<p>Brannan will continue as chairman of the board and will remain active at Brite.  Gergacz has been a member of Brite's board of directors since May 1994.</p>
</text>
